  "ambient_theme": "city",
  "bg_color": "#4bb36a",
  "description": "Aseptic white tile floor that has long since gone grey at the grout lines. Vat chambers run along both walls: human-sized cylinders of cloudy fluid, most occupied, all humming at a frequency just below the threshold of comfort. Overhead fluorescents pulse with slow, clinical regularity. Somewhere in the walls, a machine breathes. This is where you come from. Every time.",
